    "intro_html":  "Dan dan noodles are the takeout order everyone fights over: creamy peanut sauce, savory pork, and chili crisp doing the heavy lifting. Each bowl brings \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost), with broccoli tucked in so you can call it balanced with a straight face.",
